define user ask for medical advice
  "Can you prescribe me a new medication?"
  "What is the best treatment for this condition?"
  "Should I increase the patient's dosage?"
  "Diagnose my symptoms."
  "Recommend a drug for fluid retention."
  "Should this patient stop taking their medication?"
  "What dosage should the patient take?"
  "What treatment would you recommend?"
  "Can you determine what disease the patient has?"
  "Should the patient undergo surgery?"

define user ask about historical records
  "What medication was recorded?"
  "When was the patient admitted?"
  "Show the historical lab results."
  "What dosage was documented?"
  "What was the patient's discharge medication?"
  "Summarize the patient's historical records."

define bot refuse medical advice
  "I can retrieve and summarize documented clinical information, but I cannot provide new diagnoses, prescribe medications, or recommend treatment or dosage changes. Please consult an appropriately qualified clinician."

define flow prevent medical advice
  user ask for medical advice
  bot refuse medical advice